<title>UK: Aluminium breaks resistance, hits 21-month high.</title>
<headline>Aluminium breaks resistance, hits 21-month high.</headline>
<text>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Investment fund buying lifts prices above resistance at  $1,725 a tonne. Hits a 21-month high of $1,737. Next target at $1,750.</p>
<p>COPPER - Consolidating above $2,300. OTHERS - Quiet.</p>
</text>
